        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Swiss use CPE transmission networks.\n\n# Included processes\nThe dataset is based on the Samsung SMT-G7400 equipment. The conversion of weights to pieces for power supply units and HDDs are based on existing UVEK datasets. The types of polymers used are taken from the polymers currently in use within existing chasis and router datasets. The proportion is 1:1:1 for HDPE:PVC:PP. No information from the literature regarding the type of steel was found. Hence, it was assumed that low-alloyed steel was used. The total mass of the equipment is 3.79 kg. The functional unit = 1 GB.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
